flowchart LR
  Goal[User goal] --> Route[Route and screen]
  Route --> Control[Button, field, option or background event]
  Control --> Handler[React handler]
  Handler --> State[Frontend and session state]
  State --> Choice{Dependency}
  Choice -->|Frontend only| Visible[Visible result]
  Choice -->|Supabase| RLS[JWT plus RLS and Storage or RPC]
  Choice -->|Local AI| Server[TanStack server adapter]
  Server --> JWT[Verified bearer and ownership]
  JWT --> Backend[Local backend service]
  Backend --> Model[Local model runtime]
  Backend --> DB[Supabase using user JWT or narrow worker]
  RLS --> Normalize[Normalize response or error]
  Model --> Normalize
  DB --> Normalize
  Normalize --> State2[State transition and persistence]
  State2 --> Visible
  Normalize -->|failure| Error[Localized retry, blocked or unavailable state]
